ssis comes to meet Caroline's plane but he doesn't seem happy – he has seen that the mining company have already started building the road which threatens Leopard's Den.","genres":["Series","Biographical Drama","Drama"]},{"id":"ftv_WildatHeart_us","title":"Wild At Heart: Episode 9","released":"2026-11-28T11:31:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T11:31:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T12:24:00Z","overview":"The family are making arrangements to leave Leopard's Den, all except Du Plessis who is steadfastly refusing to accept that he has lost his home. He won't use his share of the money from the sale of the land to buy somewhere else.","genres":["Series","Biographical Drama","Drama"]},{"id":"ftv_WildatHeart_us","title":"Wild At Heart: Episode 10","released":"2026-11-28T12:24:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T12:24:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T13:18:00Z","overview":"The family have been squatting at Leopard's Den as they prepare to make their last stand to prevent the bulldozers from destroying their home. Du Plessis and Fatani bring elephants and a giraffe to dissuade the construction crew from moving in.","genres":["Series","Biographical Drama","Drama"]},{"id":"ftv_WildatHeart_us","title":"Wild At Heart","released":"2026-11-28T13:18:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T13:18:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T14:12:00Z","overview":"After the devastating loss of Leopard's Den, the family are split across continents. Caroline, Liv and a heavily pregnant Alice are in the UK, while Danny and Du Plessis have remained in South Africa.","genres":["Series","Biographical Drama","Drama"]},{"id":"ftv_WildatHeart_us","title":"Wild At Heart: Episode 2","released":"2026-11-28T14:12:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T14:12:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T15:05:00Z","overview":"Danny returns to South Africa with Caroline, Liv and Charlotte. They are all excited to be back and are looking forward to seeing their new home, Clearwater Farm.","genres":["Series","Biographical Drama","Drama"]},{"id":"ftv_WildatHeart_us","title":"Wild At Heart: Episode 3","released":"2026-11-28T15:05:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T15:05:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T15:58:00Z","overview":"Danny has been preparing his pitch for an Endangered Species Project. JLW, a pharmaceutical company, are looking to fund an environmental project and the family hope that this grant money will enable them to buy Leopard's Den and Mara.","genres":["Series","Biographical Drama","Drama"]},{"id":"ftv_WildatHeart_us","title":"Wild At Heart: Episode 4","released":"2026-11-28T15:58:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T15:58:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T16:51:00Z","overview":"Danny and Ed release two cheetah brothers together, a symbol of their new partnership, but not all of the family are happy about this new start. Caroline is still furious at what she sees as Danny's betrayal of Du Plessis.","genres":["Series","Biographical Drama","Drama"]},{"id":"ftv_WildatHeart_us","title":"Wild At Heart: Episode 5","released":"2026-11-28T16:51:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T16:51:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T17:45:00Z","overview":"The family are still estranged following Caroline's decision to move back to the decrepit Clearwater house with Du Plessis. Rosie is determined to reunite everyone, and plans a civilised dinner as a step towards reconciliation.","genres":["Series","Biographical Drama","Drama"]},{"id":"ftv_WildatHeart_us","title":"Wild At Heart: Episode 6","released":"2026-11-28T17:45:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T17:45:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T18:38:00Z","overview":"Danny is in prison, accused of murdering Peeters, but Du Plessis is determined to prove his friend's innocence by any means he can. Du Plessis' first attempt backfires disastrously when he harangues a police officer and ends up in a cell next to Danny.","genres":["Series","Biographical Drama","Drama"]},{"id":"ftv_WildatHeart_us","title":"Wild At Heart: Episode 7","released":"2026-11-28T18:38:00Z","startTime":"2026-11-28T18:38:00Z","endTime":"2026-11-28T19:31:00Z","overview":"With Danny away, 